<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41035" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rēmĭgo</span></b> ,
		āre, v. n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to row</i> (class.), <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				13, 21, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">utrum mavis? statimne vela facere, an paululum
					remigare?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 4, 4, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non intermisso remigandi labore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes. B.
					G. 5, 8</span></i>
			; Auct. B. Alex. 46, 2; <i><span class="en">Tac. Agr. 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contra aquam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 122 al.</span></i>
			—<b>Poet.</b>, with <i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">remigare alnum (i. e. navem),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Rapt. Pros. 2, 178</span></i>
			.</div>
